{"info": {"address1": "Chiripal House", "address2": "Shivranjani Cross Road Satellite", "city": "Ahmedabad", "zip": "380015", "country": "India", "phone": "91 79 6966 0000", "fax": "91 79 2676 8656", "website": "https://nandandenim.com", "industry": "Textile Manufacturing", "industryKey": "textile-manufacturing", "industryDisp": "Textile Manufacturing", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Nandan Denim Limited manufactures and sells denim, shirting materials, yarn, and various fabrics in India. The company offers denim products, such as core classics, reinvented classics, novelty, structured, knit, light weight, blends, feather touch, stretch tech, and prints denims; shirting products, including plain weaves, twill, dobby, chambray, fil-\u00e0-fil, herringbone, basket weave, and pinpoint oxford; and dyed yarns in multiple blends and counts, grey cotton fabrics, and khakis. It also exports its products. The company offers its products to fabric re-sellers, garment converters, distributors, wholesalers, dealers, brand owners, and exporters. The company was formerly known as Nandan Exim Limited and changed its name to Nandan Denim Limited in November 2013. Nandan Denim Limited was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Ahmedabad, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 2126, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jyotiprasad Devkinandan Chiripal", "age": 72, "title": "MD & Executive Chairman", "yearBorn": 1953, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Deepak J. Chiripal", "age": 46, "title": "Chief Executive Officer", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Suresh Chand Maheshwari", "age": 67, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Rinku Hardikkumar Patel"